WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.946
Forgot your password? Now there is a way back in.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.932
Under the password field on Sign in, Forgot your password opens a short form, on

00:00:12.932 --> 00:00:14.342
phone and desktop.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.517
Enter the email you joined with and press send. The button says, sending, then the

00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:22.855
screen tells you to check your email.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.989
Whether we know that email or not, the answer is exactly the same, so nobody can use

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:33.546
this form to find out who is a member.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.300
A member gets one email with a link that lasts thirty minutes. We keep only a

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.890
fingerprint of it, never the link itself.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.646
An email that isn't complete is named on the field before anything is sent.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.021
If the server fails, a message says so, and your email stays, ready to try again.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.384
And one account gets at most three links an hour, so no inbox can be flooded.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.263
Next, slice twenty point two: choose a new password.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.932
That's slice twenty point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health

00:01:26.932 --> 00:01:28.375
in body and spirit.
